Totem Dies
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                ((Triggering unit) is in TotemGroupNazgrek.) Equal to True
                ((Triggering unit) is in TotemGroupZulkis.) Equal to True
                ((Triggering unit) is in TotemGroupRestoshaman.) Equal to True
    Actions
        -------- ============================== --------
        -------- Floating Text --------
        Floating Text - Destroy TotemText[(Custom value of (Triggering unit))]
        -------- ============================== --------
        -------- Turn OFF Autocast Totems --------
        -------- ============== FIRE TOTEMS --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Fire Totem AutoCast Fire Shield <gen> is on) Equal to True
                (Number of living Fire Totem units owned by Player 1 (Red)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Fire Totem units owned by Player 2 (Blue)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Greater Fire Totem units owned by Player 1 (Red)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Greater Fire Totem units owned by Player 2 (Blue)) Equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                Trigger - Turn off Fire Totem AutoCast Fire Shield <gen>
            Else - Actions
        -------- ============== WIND TOTEMS --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        (Wind Totem AutoCast Cyclone <gen> is on) Equal to True
                        (Wind Totem Greater AutoCast Lightning <gen> is on) Equal to True
                (Number of living Wind Totem units owned by Player 1 (Red)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Greater Wind Totem units owned by Player 1 (Red)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Wind Totem units owned by Player 2 (Blue)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Greater Wind Totem units owned by Player 2 (Blue)) Equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                Trigger - Turn off Wind Totem AutoCast Cyclone <gen>
                Trigger - Turn off Wind Totem Greater AutoCast Lightning <gen>
            Else - Actions
        -------- ============== CLEANSING TOTEMS --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        (Cleansing Totem Level 1 <gen> is on) Equal to True
                        (Cleansing Totem Level 2 <gen> is on) Equal to True
                (Number of living Cleansing Totem units owned by Player 1 (Red)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Greater Cleansing Totem units owned by Player 1 (Red)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Cleansing Totem units owned by Player 2 (Blue)) Equal to 0
                (Number of living Greater Cleansing Totem units owned by Player 2 (Blue)) Equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                Trigger - Turn off Cleansing Totem Level 1 <gen>
                Trigger - Turn off Cleansing Totem Level 2 <gen>
            Else - Actions
        -------- ============================== --------
        -------- Remove "REAL" totem --------
        Unit - Remove (Triggering unit) from the game
        -------- Create and Kill "DUMMY" totem --------
        Set VariableSet DummyTotemPoint = (Position of (Triggering unit))
        Unit - Create 1 (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) for Player 1 (Red) at DummyTotemPoint facing Default building facing degrees
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_DummyTotemPoint)
        Unit - Kill (Last created unit)
        -------- ============================== --------
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
